{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39543","headline":"夏日题老将林亭 · 张蠙","name":"夏日题老将林亭","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"百战功成翻爱静，侯门渐欲似仙家。\n墙头雨细垂纤草，水面风回聚落花。\n井放辘轳闲侵酒，笼开鹦鹉报煎茶。\n几人图在凌烟阁，曾不交锋向塞沙。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张蠙","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_39543.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39543","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}